'''Sunbathers''' (日光浴, ''Nikkōyoku'', '''Sunbathing''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

